  "readmeExcerpt": "# @open-mercato/content 📄\n\nStatic content module for policy and legal pages in Open Mercato apps.\n\n`@open-mercato/content` provides a clean way to ship pages like Privacy Policy, Terms, and other managed static content.\n\n## Why this package ✨\n\n- 🧾 Legal and policy pages out of the box\n- 🧩 Fits directly into the module auto-discovery system\n- 🌍 Works with platform i18n workflows\n- ⚡ Keeps static content maintainable and versionable\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nyarn add @open-mercato/content\n```\n\n## Learn more\n\n- GitHub (package): https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato/tree/main/packages/content\n- GitHub (project): https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato\n- Docs: https://docs.openmercato.com\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n",
